A PERSONAL TOOL
OptiGame+ (GameOptimizer and GameClear merged) was made for the author's own use and is shared as is. It comes
with no support, no promise of updates and no warranty. It edits game settings
files and registry values, and it changes the priority and efficiency mode of running
programs while a game runs. It backs settings up first and restores the rest when the game
closes, but use it at your own risk.

BUILT WITH AI
The code was written by Claude, an AI model from Anthropic, through Claude Code,
following the author's instructions. It has not had a professional review or a
security audit, and some of its choices will be wrong for some games. The
graphics card scores and slider profiles are rough estimates.

